WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
One pull request, one commit: the head is a1b2c3d

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Each gate posts its verdict on that exact commit

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Then a push moves the head to e4f5a6b

4
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Statuses belong to a commit, so the new head has none

5
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:58.000
gate:merge refuses until all three are re-run

6
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Each gate re-runs on e4f5a6b

7
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
All green on the new head: the merge is pinned to e4f5a6b
